{"schema_version":1,"status":"partial","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01246-s02","batch":1246,"shard":2,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":40,"shard_end_exclusive":60,"translated_count":10,"worker_id":"gpt56sol-auto11-20260906T000600Z-translation","updated_at":"2026-09-06T00:10:00Z","entries":[{"entry_index":40,"uid":"zhcn:401d737676a702665ce907c8","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"总之就提起干劲来做吧——","source_fingerprint":"36d1d79bd80b86635485f7009a93a2efd115b99cdc3335b04495b39f82f36996","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20005"],"target_text":"Tóm lại cứ lấy tinh thần lên rồi làm thôi——","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":41,"uid":"zhcn:047bc1c850fcae784ad816ba","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"你好——\r\n今天我们要做什么呢——？","source_fingerprint":"d75adef75c451c08395ec58851beea38fd6c95aa94c28b06a5eb761d62b978fd","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20006"],"target_text":"Xin chào——\r\nHôm nay chúng ta làm gì đây——?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":42,"uid":"zhcn:274df7646eadc61bd0e0fb00","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔唔唔，训练……\r\n好啦，那就来做吧～","source_fingerprint":"1bbbee9f32fed235aba6e40d587b720ac7d3fec4c16a1c27612cc036cd02e7a2","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20007"],"target_text":"Ư ư ư, huấn luyện……\r\nThôi được, vậy làm nào～","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":43,"uid":"zhcn:541065076b37d25fc977681a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"训练员，我们还是来去钓鱼吧，\r\n钓鱼～","source_fingerprint":"071b28100ee5713fd4fc27de65680ac64c7cbaffbcf18d11a33476529abd1df6","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20008"],"target_text":"Trainer, hay là chúng ta đi câu cá đi,\r\ncâu cá～","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":44,"uid":"zhcn:e8e998bce5db8286ff610760","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"哎呀——毕竟你的对象是我嘛，\r\n觉得我会认真做训练……\r\n可别对我有这种过高的期待哦——","source_fingerprint":"ebbd56d595d1ac8ace1fa99b5b4aa06323c508200f6b7b320eab51b9e6bafece","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20009"],"target_text":"Ôi chà—— dù sao người cậu phụ trách là mình mà,\r\nnghĩ rằng mình sẽ nghiêm túc huấn luyện……\r\nđừng kỳ vọng cao đến thế nhé——","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":45,"uid":"zhcn:a8d1e58845182cd4da529f6b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……我们真的要做训练吗——？","source_fingerprint":"44b40067ea705464b44f0ca4cb7a543c82c8961e50989b13f4eec5ecd05e56fd","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20010"],"target_text":"…… Chúng ta thật sự phải huấn luyện à——?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":46,"uid":"zhcn:c35cfd638c0b265dcc3cda8d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"啊——不行了，我一步也不想动了。\r\n能做到这种程度，\r\n可以称赞我了吧——？","source_fingerprint":"d946bcc164f9297b8da8fa1592e061b91f36f7578d4ad75ca7f833a834b2605f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20011"],"target_text":"A—— không được rồi, mình chẳng muốn bước thêm bước nào nữa.\r\nLàm được đến mức này rồi,\r\nkhen mình một câu được chứ——?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":47,"uid":"zhcn:5a95552bf1bb065ca6e0f042","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……嗯——比赛哦——\r\n但我好像有点累了耶——？","source_fingerprint":"b02e3a36990d49467e31e83ad981ee29161d1e30dc92c65872b2a090fc62efed","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20021"],"target_text":"…… Ừm—— Race à——\r\nNhưng hình như mình hơi mệt rồi——?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":48,"uid":"zhcn:b45edacb54db5ee6186bbad0","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"一直在比赛的话，\r\n不就什么对策都做不出来了吗？\r\n……我只是说说看而已啦——","source_fingerprint":"2a12921a634291a76eda5580a243722a4964d80b214fb72753b604904dc7f6e2","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20022"],"target_text":"Cứ thi Race liên tục thế này,\r\nthì chẳng phải không kịp chuẩn bị đối sách gì sao?\r\n…… Mình chỉ nói thử thôi mà——","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":49,"uid":"zhcn:b751d6ac677b7fc3f691ac50","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呵，呵，呵——\r\n就让你看看我的青云之志吧——！","source_fingerprint":"83af198d2f844007f67a21353903083713d14d0a463bdc6e58bfd951c6a62bbc","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20023"],"target_text":"Hơ, hơ, hơ——\r\nĐể cậu xem chí lớn của mình nhé——!","reviewed":true}]}
